# Explicit binary handling — don't rely on git's own binary-detection
# heuristic (which happened to guess right for these so far, but that's
# luck, not a guarantee) for line-ending normalization on assets where
# CRLF conversion would silently corrupt the file.
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.webp  binary
*.jar   binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks   binary
